  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming High Level Energy Study Visit Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 3-5 days incoming study visit to the Netherlands will provide the Senegalese authorities in oil and gas sector development with an understanding of Dutch solutions that can be used as an inspiration to enhance positive economic impacts and manage social and environmental challenges regarding the exploitation of recent oil and gas findings in Senegal. This improved understanding will be beneficial for the Dutch private sector, which is very keen on investing in Senegal after the oil and gas trade mission in May 2017 and the soon upcoming Dutch government aid and trade initiatives to assist the Senegalese government in responsible and effective natural resource governance.</narrative>
  </description>
